== Pickled Eggs with Beets ==

Drain @beets{1%can}, reserving 1 cup juice.

Place some beets, @garlic{6%cloves}(whole), @black peppercorns{1/8%teaspoon}(whole), @salt{pinch}, and @hardboiled eggs{6}(peeled) in a #2-qt glass jar{}.

In a #small saucepan{}, add @white sugar{1%cup}, @water{1 1/4%cups}, @cider vinegar{3/4%cup}, and reserved beet juice and bring to a boil. Simmer for ~{1-2%minutes} and pour the hot liquid over beets and eggs, let it fully cool.

Cover tightly with a lid and refrigerate for at least 24-48 hours before serving.

== Rosemary Garlic Pickled Eggs ==

In a small saucepan, add @white sugar{1%cup}, @water{1 1/4%cups}, and @cider vinegar{3/4%cup} and bring to a boil. Simmer for ~{1-2%minutes}.

Place @hardboiled eggs{6}(peeled) and the rest of the ingredients in a 2-qt glass jar: @garlic{6%cloves}(whole), @lemon peel{1%lemon}, @rosemary{5%sprigs}, @black peppercorns{1/8%teaspoon}(whole), and @salt{pinch}.

Pour the hot liquid over the eggs and let them fully cool.

Cover tightly with a lid and refrigerate for at least 24-48 hours before serving.

== Dill Pickled Eggs and Veggies ==

In a small saucepan, add @white sugar{1%cup}, @water{1 1/4%cups}, @cider vinegar{3/4%cup} and bring to a boil. Simmer for ~{1-2%minutes}.

Place @hardboiled eggs{6}(peeled) and the rest of the ingredients in a 2-qt glass jar: @garlic{4%cloves}(whole), @carrot rounds{6}, @zucchini rounds{6}, @fresh dill{5%sprigs}, @black peppercorns{1/8%teaspoon}(whole), and @salt{pinch}.

Pour the hot liquid over the eggs and let them fully cool.

Cover tightly with a lid and refrigerate for at least 24-48 hours before serving.